%%{init: {'theme': 'forest'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI Args
    participant App as Bevy App
    participant DB as DuckDB
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant Binance as Binance API
    participant Chat as Chat UI
    participant Claude as Claude API
    participant Render as Renderer

    Note over CLI,Render: STARTUP PHASE

    CLI->>App: Parse args (ticker, timeframe, dates)
    App->>DB: Validate data exists
    DB-->>App: Data confirmed

    App->>App: Initialize Bevy App with Plugins
    Note right of App: DefaultPlugins<br/>ChatUiPlugin<br/>WebSocketPlugin<br/>RealtimePlugin<br/>RemotePlugin

    App->>DB: Load candles for date range
    DB-->>App: Return Vec of Candle

    App->>App: Setup systems run
    Note right of App: Create Chart resource<br/>Initialize entity pools<br/>Calculate pane layouts<br/>Spawn UI entities

    App->>WS: Spawn WebSocket task
    WS->>Binance: Connect to kline stream
    Binance-->>WS: Connection established

    App->>Chat: Initialize Claude client
    Chat->>Chat: Spawn async Claude task

    Note over CLI,Render: MAIN LOOP (each frame)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        Note over App,Render: Input Phase
        App->>App: handle_focus_tab
        App->>App: handle_focus_click
        App->>App: handle_mouse_input
        App->>App: handle_timeframe_keyboard
    end

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over App,DB: Data Phase
        App->>App: reset_aggregation_frame_state
        App->>App: apply_deferred_updates
        App->>App: detect_aggregation_level_change
        App->>App: check_lazy_load
        alt Lazy load triggered
            App->>DB: Load additional candles
            DB-->>App: New candle data
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over WS,Claude: Real-time & Chat Phase
        WS->>WS: process_websocket_events
        Binance-->>WS: Kline update
        WS->>App: WebSocketEvent::Kline
        App->>App: apply_throttled_updates

        Chat->>Chat: handle_text_submit
        alt User sent message
            Chat->>Claude: Send via channel
            Claude->>Claude: Process with SDK
            Claude-->>Chat: Response via channel
            Chat->>Chat: update_message_display
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 245)
        Note over App,Render: Rendering Phase
        App->>Render: render_grid_and_axes
        App->>Render: render_candlesticks
        Note right of Render: Uses entity pooling<br/>LOD based on zoom
        App->>Render: render_moving_averages
        App->>Render: render_volume_bars
        App->>Render: update_crosshair
        App->>App: discover_and_pool_entities
        App->>App: reset_redraw_flag
    end

    Note over CLI,Render: SCREENSHOT FLOW (on demand)

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Claude->>App: BRP: chart/screenshot
        App->>App: handle_screenshot
        App->>App: take_screenshot
        App->>App: crop_screenshot_to_chart
        App-->>Claude: Screenshot path
    end
